<NPR>NOTE:  Add applicable requirements.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>[_____].</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
][<SPT><TTL>INSTRUMENTATION</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
[<SPT><TTL>Piezometers and Observation Wells</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Install piezometers and observation wells as shown.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
][<SPT><TTL>Settlement Markers and Survey Monuments</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Install survey monuments and settlement markers as shown.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
][<SPT><TTL>Settlement Gages</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
